career_history:
[{'company': 'Paytm', 'title': 'Staff Machine Learning Engineer', 'start_date': '2024-11-03', 'end_date': None, 'duration_months': 19, 'is_current': True, 'industry': 'Fintech', 'company_size': '10001+', 'description': 'Built and shipped a production recommendation system at a marketplace product, going from offline experimentation to live A/B test in 5 months. The system combined collaborative filtering (matrix factorization), content-based features (TF-IDF + sentence-transformer embeddings), and a behavioral re-ranking layer. The most interesting technical challenge was the cold-start problem for new users; I designed an exploration-exploitation policy using Thompson sampling that improved new-user retention by 11% in the first month.'}
 {'company': 'Razorpay', 'title': 'Senior NLP Engineer', 'start_date': '2023-08-27', 'end_date': '2024-10-20', 'duration_months': 14, 'is_current': False, 'industry': 'Fintech', 'company_size': '1001-5000', 'description': 'Owned the design and rollout of a large-scale semantic search system serving an internal corpus of 35M+ items. Migrated the existing BM25-only retrieval to a hybrid setup combining sparse and dense vectors (sentence-transformers, MPNet-base initially, later fine-tuned BGE-large for our domain). The new system reduced p95 retrieval latency by 60% while improving NDCG@10 by 18% on our held-out eval set. Spent substantial time on the boring-but-critical parts: incremental index refresh, embedding drift monitoring, online/offline metric correlation. Led a team of 4 engineers across the rollout.'}
 {'company': 'Glance', 'title': 'Senior NLP Engineer', 'start_date': '2020-01-08', 'end_date': '2023-08-20', 'duration_months': 44, 'is_current': False, 'industry': 'AI/ML', 'company_size': '501-1000', 'description': 'Led the migration from keyword-based to embedding-based search across a 30M+ candidate corpus over 8 months. Designed three successive ranker variants and ran them in A/B testing alongside the legacy keyword system. The final embedding ranker improved recruiter engagement metrics by 24% and reduced the average time-to-shortlist by 38%. Most of the engineering effort went into the boring infrastructure: index versioning, embedding versioning, rollback paths, and the dashboards that let recruiters trust the new system. Mentored two junior engineers through this rollout.'}
 {'company': 'Aganitha', 'title': 'Senior AI Engineer', 'start_date': '2019-06-12', 'end_date': '2019-12-09', 'duration_months': 6, 'is_current': False, 'industry': 'AI/ML', 'company_size': '51-200', 'description': 'Led the migration from keyword-based to embedding-based search across a 30M+ candidate corpus over 8 months. Designed three successive ranker variants and ran them in A/B testing alongside the legacy keyword system. The final embedding ranker improved recruiter engagement metrics by 24% and reduced the average time-to-shortlist by 38%. Most of the engineering effort went into the boring infrastructure: index versioning, embedding versioning, rollback paths, and the dashboards that let recruiters trust the new system. Mentored two junior engineers through this rollout.'}]

